%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-runtime-functions-failif (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import failIf from dw::Runtime
var result = {"a":"test"}
output application/json
---
{ "result" : result failIf isEmpty($) }
%%% output application/json
{
  "result": {
    "a": "test"
  }
}
